833", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303788_684225454395166_4669500940882966481_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ICoK8MtzIJ0Q7kNvwEZXb83&_nc_oc=AdkSeEv9d_bhDKe6lwPdzkC29Ti_xGUzFwvRt6FyscrunKTPx6xu-BPhrfXsObkctWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu35lX7YKLSEN1crYQWSDN3gGboGmYrDI7M8CPe6Gv9EA&oe=69A43C1E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 3.png", "id": "712797527816902", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300549_712797531150235_7255838885968633153_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lC_pi1SVVdkQ7kNvwE_AD8u&_nc_oc=AdndfXyLnd_OIaQAbLzCh39aZaw52xSAS-E5nbS4Qp98-L1auUUmgUKyU9GCdQ0bAJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftWQlUZbb6C6KHtTvHEs0z_7IpUwST52xmzqIzsMRr6Kw&oe=69A44591"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Valve Tagg", "keywords": ["tag", "project", "taggers", "tagg", "tags"], "long_description": "\"Valve Tagg\" is a captivating VR game designed to immerse players in a tranquil yet engaging environment. Set in a serene virtual world filled with lush landscapes, calming music, and picturesque scenery, the game offers a unique experience of relaxation and creativity.\nThe objective of \"Valve Tagg\" is simple yet delightful: players use virtual reality tools to create beautiful, glowing art installations throughout the game world.\nThese installations can take the form of intricate patterns.", "short_description": "\"Valve Tagg\", an interesting gorilla tag fangame."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gTxMV6lnqtn8qWj4hWBGpKMNtJlnK_zM6_XgFZhmp28/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Signal", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://html.cafe/x0ad04eab", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GA